<item>
      <title><![CDATA[Watching movies in Spanish… again]]></title>
      <description><![CDATA[This post is for you if you like TV... and would love to like TV in Spanish!]]></description>
      <link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/watching-movies-in-spanish-again</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">post:206067057</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 18:42:39 GMT</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png" length="0" type="image/png"/>
      <substacker:source>export</substacker:source>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don’t need to understand every word, just keep reading.</span></strong></p><p><span>Para mí, becario de profesión, la tele es una herramienta más para aprender idiomas, y creo que me ha ayudado mucho a lo largo de los años. El cerebro humano aprende a usar el lenguaje partiendo de cero; la maquinaria ya está ahí. </span><em><span>Might as well use it!</span></em></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><span>La clave está en la repetición y en la exposición gradual a estímulos del nivel adecuado. Aunque sea tan gradual que ni nos damos cuenta, a nivel subconsciente pasan cosas. Recuerdo ver la misma película una y otra vez cuando era pequeño. Para mí, eso es un superpoder. Yo diría que funciona así:</span></p><ul><li><p><span>¿Ver una película sin entenderla? </span><em><span>Linguistic exposure</span></em><span>.</span></p></li><li><p><span>¿Con subtítulos en nuestro idioma? </span><em><span>Setting the mood.</span></em></p></li><li><p><span>¿Subtítulos en versión original? </span><em><span>We’re in business!</span></em></p></li><li><p><span>¿Sin subtítulos? </span><em><span>God Mode.</span></em></p></li></ul><p></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png" width="1024" height="608" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:608,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0-5h!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0c9c9293-358c-440a-a6d7-56270c4d37b4_1024x608.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Wait, what?</figcaption></figure></div><p><span>Hace unas semanas, comentando uno de los posts de la jefa sobre </span><a href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/watching-movies-in-spanish-even-if"><span>cine en español</span></a><span>, recomendé la fantástica </span><strong><a href="https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3011894/"><span>Relatos salvajes (2014)</span></a><span>,</span></strong><span> de Damián Szifron. La vuelvo a recomendar porque es una película que no te dejará indiferente, incluso si no entiendes el idioma. Si vas a ver la misma película varias veces, al menos que sea divertida, ¿no?</span></p><p><span>La peli en sí es como si la vida te diera una bofetada y encima te hiciera reír mientras te duele la cara. Es una comedia negra (</span><em><span>dark comedy</span></em><span>) con seis historias independientes donde gente “normal” se harta de la burocracia, del tráfico, de las infidelidades, del sistema judicial… y decide pasar de la civilización al </span><em><span>modo bestia</span></em><span>. No quiero destriparla con spoilers, pero pasa un poco de todo: encuentros surrealistas a bordo de un avión, episodios de furia al volante, declaraciones de guerra a la grúa municipal, tráfico de influencias. En fin, una joya.</span></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/watching-movies-in-spanish-again?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/watching-movies-in-spanish-again?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p><span>Te animo a darle una oportunidad. El humor es negro como el café concentrado de un lunes por la mañana: puro caos y decisiones catastróficas donde todo termina reventando, pero con estilo, eso sí. </span><em><span>Gabriel Pasternak wouldn’t have it any other way!</span></em></p><p><span>¿Y a ti, qué tipo de cine te gusta?</span></p><p></p>]]></content:encoded>
